# Diagnostic dumps written by integration tests when they fail (currently
# segment_queue_concurrency_test.go). They are timestamped, so every run leaves
# another one and they never stop accumulating in git status. Two had been
# committed before this rule existed and were untracked with it.
tests/integration/diagnostics/*.json

# MaxMind GeoIP databases. The City database shipped with Notifuse is tracked
# on purpose (see data/GeoLite2-City.mmdb); any other .mmdb is a local download
# and has no business in the history — they weigh ~60 MB each.
*.mmdb
!data/GeoLite2-City.mmdb


